---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro'
import { committee } from '../data/committee'
---

<BaseLayout title="Business plan" description="ISO/TC 12's strategic business plan — published on the ISO website, periodically reviewed at plenary meetings.">
  <div class="max-w-[1320px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-10 pt-12">
    <PageHero
      eyebrow="Strategy"
      ordinal="07"
      title="Strategic Business Plan"
      lede="TC 12 maintains a Strategic Business Plan (SBP) on the ISO website. The plan is reviewed at every plenary and updated through Committee Internal Ballot."
    />
  </div>

  <section class="max-w-[1320px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-10 mt-16">
    <div class="hairline pt-8 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-12">
      <div class="md:col-span-7 prose-tc12 max-w-none">
        <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-medium mb-3">Current plan</h3>
        <p>
          The Strategic Business Plan describes TC 12's scope, the
          global relevance of its work, the structure of its programme,
          and its objectives. It is reviewed at every plenary meeting.
        </p>
        <p>
          At the 23rd plenary (May 2026), the committee resolved to
          reformat the draft SBP (N1609) into the latest ISO template
          and circulate it for approval via Committee Internal Ballot.
        </p>

        <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-medium mb-3 mt-10">Recent reviews</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 mt-4">
          <li class="hairline pt-2 text-sm grid grid-cols-12 gap-3">
            <span class="col-span-3 font-mono text-xs text-muted">2026-05-26</span>
            <span class="col-span-9">23rd plenary — draft SBP (N1609) to be reformatted to ISO template, then CIB</span>
          </li>
          <li class="hairline pt-2 text-sm grid grid-cols-12 gap-3">
            <span class="col-span-3 font-mono text-xs text-muted">2025-05-22</span>
            <span class="col-span-9">22nd plenary — update to SBP v.12, comments invited then CIB</span>
          </li>
          <li class="hairline pt-2 text-sm grid grid-cols-12 gap-3">
            <span class="col-span-3 font-mono text-xs text-muted">2024-05-16</span>
            <span class="col-span-9">21st plenary — confirmed SBP v.11 (N1488)</span>
          </li>
          <li class="hairline pt-2 text-sm grid grid-cols-12 gap-3">
            <span class="col-span-3 font-mono text-xs text-muted">2020-09-14</span>
            <span class="col-span-9">CIB approved SBP Final v.9 rev 2 (N1377)</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <aside class="md:col-span-5 md:border-l md:border-rule md:pl-8">
        <div class="eyebrow">Published plan</div>
        <a
          href="https://www.iso.org/committee/45976.html"
          class="block mt-3 font-display text-lg hover:text-wine transition-colors"
        >
          ISO/TC 12 SBP on iso.org ↗
        </a>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted mt-3 italic">
          The current plan is hosted on the ISO website. Older drafts are
          in TC 12's historic document corpus.
        </p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
